From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3dx9_36 gap batch 2: teapot, compress, disassemble effect, palettized save, formats, env maps, fragments (3641)

d3dx9_36 gap batch 2: teapot, keyframed Compress and compressed animation sets, DisassembleEffect, palettized surface save, L6V5U5/XR_BIAS/A1/D16_LOCKABLE, RenderToEnvMap sphere/hemisphere/parabolic, D3DXGatherFragments and the fragment linker. See patches/notes/3641.txt.
